      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 23,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Be still, you inhabitants of the coast, you whom the merchants of Sidon that pass over the sea have replenished.",
      "ko": "바다에 왕래하는 시돈 상고로 말미암아 부요하게 된 너희 해변 거민들아 잠잠하라",
      "source_text_hash": "90c37b22859f108a78918a5232b2ae8bfa93161c8a876d56196840ceead32be4",
      "translation_text_hash": "dcfd5495a208960075ac651d363e03c271cb48f5562d7ab9cdecb8202d30efc7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "바다에 왕래하는 시돈 상고로 말미암아 부요하게 된 너희 해변 거민들아 잠잠하라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "dcfd5495a208960075ac651d363e03c271cb48f5562d7ab9cdecb8202d30efc7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ISA:23:3",
      "sequence": 18081,
